WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,110
What if I say no?

2
00:00:05,340 --> 00:00:06,980
Even your eldest brother Song Wensheng

3
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,340
Don't dare to talk to me like that

4
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:09,620
Song Kaiming

5
00:00:10,020 --> 00:00:11,500
I'll give you face and you can continue.

6
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:13,580
Don't be ashamed of this

7
00:00:13,860 --> 00:00:15,900
At any rate, it was Mei Changgong’s student who died.

8
00:00:16,140 --> 00:00:18,500
We need to get to the bottom of it no matter what.

9
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,990
Still happy in the Northern Territory

10
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:32,270
It's a problem when you encounter someone who doesn't understand people's words

11
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:35,120
What if the building is destroyed?

12
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:37,000
General Yun can't even speak.

13
00:00:37,320 --> 00:00:38,620
Strange

14
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:48,890
What happened to the Du family's heart?
